) VALUES (
    'stefan-kraft-profile',
    '{"en": "Stefan Kraft: Ski Jumping''s Flying Legend", "de": "Stefan Kraft: Skisprungs fliegende Legende", "fr": "Stefan Kraft : La légende volante du saut à ski", "it": "Stefan Kraft: La leggenda volante del salto con gli sci", "es": "Stefan Kraft: La leyenda voladora del salto de esquí", "pt": "Stefan Kraft: A lenda voadora do salto de esqui", "nl": "Stefan Kraft: De vliegende legende van het schansspringen", "ar": "ستيفان كرافت: أسطورة القفز على الجليد الطائرة", "ja": "シュテファン・クラフト：スキージャンプの飛翔する伝説", "zh": "Stefan Kraft: Tiaotsue Feixiang Chuanqi", "ko": "슈테판 크라프트: 스키점프의 날으는 전설"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Austrian holds the world record for the longest ski jump in history. A multiple World Cup winner and world champion who continues to fly among the stars.", "de": "Der Österreicher hält den Weltrekord für den längsten Skisprung der Geschichte.", "fr": "L''Autrichien détient le record du monde du plus long saut à ski de l''histoire.", "it": "L''austriaco detiene il record mondiale per il salto con gli sci più lungo della storia.", "es": "El austriaco tiene el récord mundial del salto de esquí más largo de la historia.", "pt": "O austríaco detém o recorde mundial do salto de esqui mais longo da história.", "nl": "De Oostenrijker houdt het wereldrecord voor de langste skisprong in de geschiedenis.", "ar": "يحمل النمساوي الرقم القياسي العالمي لأطول قفزة تزلج في التاريخ", "ja": "オーストリア人は史上最長のスキージャンプの世界記録を保持しています。", "zh": "Zhe wei Aodili ren baochi lishi shang zuichang huaxue tiaoyue de shijie jilu.", "ko": "오스트리아인은 역사상 가장 긴 스키점프 세계 기록을 보유하고 있습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Stefan Kraft is one of the greatest <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">ski jumpers</a> in the history of the sport. The Austrian holds the world record for the longest ski jump ever recorded and has won virtually every major title in the sport.</p><h2>World Record Holder</h2><p>Kraft soared 253.5 meters in Vikersund, Norway - the longest ski jump in history. This remarkable achievement demonstrates his exceptional technique, courage, and ability to perform when conditions are right for massive distances.</p><p>Few athletes in any sport can claim to be the best ever at a measurable feat. Kraft can.</p><h2>Championship Pedigree</h2><p>Beyond the world record, Kraft has won World Cup overall titles, world championship gold medals, and countless individual competitions. His longevity at the top of the sport speaks to his technical mastery and mental strength.</p><p>He has been a fixture on World Cup podiums for over a decade, consistently competing against the world''s best.</p><h2>Austrian Excellence</h2><p>Kraft carries forward Austria''s legendary ski jumping tradition. He races against stars like <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> and <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a>''s brothers in the men''s circuit.</p><h2>Flying Technique</h2><p>What makes Kraft special is his ability to maximize every meter of flight. His aerodynamic position, timing off the jump, and control in the air combine to produce jumps that seem to defy physics.</p><h2>Legacy</h2><p>Kraft has already secured his place in ski jumping history. Yet he continues to compete at the highest level, adding to an already remarkable career that inspires the next generation of jumpers.</p>", "de": "<p>Stefan Kraft ist einer der größten <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skispringer</a> in der Geschichte des Sports. Der Österreicher hält den Weltrekord für den längsten Skisprung aller Zeiten und hat praktisch jeden großen Titel gewonnen.</p><h2>Weltrekordhalter</h2><p>Kraft flog 253,5 Meter in Vikersund, Norwegen - der längste Skisprung der Geschichte. Diese bemerkenswerte Leistung demonstriert seine außergewöhnliche Technik.</p><h2>Meisterschafts-Stammbaum</h2><p>Neben dem Weltrekord hat Kraft Weltcup-Gesamtsiege, WM-Goldmedaillen und unzählige Einzelwettkämpfe gewonnen.</p><h2>Österreichische Exzellenz</h2><p>Kraft führt Österreichs legendäre Skisprung-Tradition fort. Er kämpft gegen Stars wie <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>.</p>", "fr": "<p>Stefan Kraft est l''un des plus grands <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">sauteurs à ski</a> de l''histoire du sport. L''Autrichien détient le record du monde du plus long saut et a remporté pratiquement tous les titres majeurs.</p><h2>Détenteur du record du monde</h2><p>Kraft a volé 253,5 mètres à Vikersund, en Norvège - le plus long saut de l''histoire.</p><h2>Palmarès</h2><p>Au-delà du record du monde, Kraft a remporté des titres au classement général de la Coupe du monde et des médailles d''or aux championnats du monde.</p><h2>Excellence autrichienne</h2><p>Il affronte des stars comme <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>Stefan Kraft è uno dei più grandi <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltatori con gli sci</a> nella storia dello sport. L''austriaco detiene il record mondiale per il salto più lungo mai registrato.</p><h2>Detentore del record mondiale</h2><p>Kraft ha volato 253,5 metri a Vikersund, Norvegia - il salto più lungo della storia.</p><h2>Palmarès</h2><p>Oltre al record mondiale, Kraft ha vinto titoli di Coppa del Mondo e medaglie d''oro mondiali.</p><h2>Eccellenza austriaca</h2><p>Compete contro stelle come <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>.</p>", "es": "<p>Stefan Kraft es uno de los más grandes <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltadores de esquí</a> en la historia del deporte. El austriaco tiene el récord mundial del salto más largo jamás registrado.</p><h2>Poseedor del récord mundial</h2><p>Kraft voló 253,5 metros en Vikersund, Noruega - el salto más largo de la historia.</p><h2>Palmarés</h2><p>Además del récord mundial, Kraft ha ganado títulos de Copa del Mundo y medallas de oro mundiales.</p>", "pt": "<p>Stefan Kraft é um dos maiores <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltadores de esqui</a> da história do esporte. O austríaco detém o recorde mundial do salto mais longo já registrado.</p><h2>Detentor do recorde mundial</h2><p>Kraft voou 253,5 metros em Vikersund, Noruega - o salto mais longo da história.</p><h2>Histórico de campeonatos</h2><p>Além do recorde mundial, Kraft ganhou títulos da Copa do Mundo e medalhas de ouro mundiais.</p>", "nl": "<p>Stefan Kraft is een van de grootste <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">schansspringers</a> in de geschiedenis van de sport. De Oostenrijker houdt het wereldrecord voor de langste sprong ooit.</p><h2>Wereldrecordhouder</h2><p>Kraft vloog 253,5 meter in Vikersund, Noorwegen - de langste skisprong in de geschiedenis.</p><h2>Kampioenspedigree</h2><p>Naast het wereldrecord heeft Kraft Wereldbeker titels en WK gouden medailles gewonnen.</p>", "ar": "<p>ستيفان كرافت هو أحد أعظم <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القافزين على الجليد</a> في تاريخ الرياضة. يحمل النمساوي الرقم القياسي العالمي لأطول قفزة.</p><h2>حامل الرقم القياسي العالمي</h2><p>طار كرافت 253.5 متر في فيكرسوند، النرويج - أطول قفزة تزلج في التاريخ.</p><h2>سجل البطولات</h2><p>بالإضافة إلى الرقم القياسي، فاز كرافت بألقاب كأس العالم وميداليات ذهبية عالمية.</p>", "ja": "<p>シュテファン・クラフトは、スポーツ史上最も偉大な<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンパー</a>の一人です。オーストリア人は史上最長のスキージャンプの世界記録を保持しています。</p><h2>世界記録保持者</h2><p>クラフトはノルウェーのヴィケルスンで253.5メートルを飛びました - 史上最長のスキージャンプです。</p><h2>選手権での実績</h2><p>世界記録に加えて、クラフトはワールドカップ総合優勝と世界選手権金メダルを獲得しています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Stefan Kraft shi tiyu shi shang zuiweida de <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">huaxue tiaoyue</a> yundongyuan zhiyi. Aodili ren baochi you shi yilai zuichang huaxue tiaoyue de shijie jilu.</p><h2>Shijie jilu baochizhe</h2><p>Kraft zai Nuowei Vikersund fei le 253.5 mi - lishi shang zuichang de huaxue tiaoyue.</p><h2>Jinbiaosai jilu</h2><p>Chule shijie jilu, Kraft hai yinxu le Shijie Bei zongguanjun he shijie jinbiaosai jin pai.</p>", "ko": "<p>슈테판 크라프트는 스포츠 역사상 가장 위대한 <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a> 선수 중 하나입니다. 오스트리아인은 역대 가장 긴 스키점프 세계 기록을 보유하고 있습니다.</p><h2>세계 기록 보유자</h2><p>크라프트는 노르웨이 비케르순에서 253.5미터를 날았습니다 - 역사상 가장 긴 스키점프입니다.</p><h2>챔피언십 기록</h2><p>세계 기록 외에도 크라프트는 월드컵 종합 우승과 세계 선수권 금메달을 획득했습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'athlete-profile',
    'SJ',
    '{"en": "Stefan Kraft profile - Austrian ski jumping legend and world record holder for the longest ski jump in history at 253.5 meters, multiple World Cup champion.", "de": "Stefan Kraft Profil - Österreichische Skisprung-Legende und Weltrekordhalter.", "fr": "Profil de Stefan Kraft - Légende autrichienne du saut à ski et détenteur du record du monde.", "it": "Profilo di Stefan Kraft - Leggenda austriaca del salto con gli sci e detentore del record mondiale.", "es": "Perfil de Stefan Kraft - Leyenda austriaca del salto de esquí y poseedor del récord mundial.", "pt": "Perfil de Stefan Kraft - Lenda austríaca do salto de esqui e detentor do recorde mundial.", "nl": "Stefan Kraft profiel - Oostenrijkse schansspringlegend en wereldrecordhouder.", "ar": "ملف ستيفان كرافت - أسطورة القفز على الجليد النمساوية وحامل الرقم القياسي العالمي", "ja": "シュテファン・クラフトのプロフィール - オーストリアのスキージャンプレジェンドで世界記録保持者", "zh": "Stefan Kraft jianjie - Aodili huaxue tiaoyue chuanqi he shijie jilu baochizhe", "ko": "슈테판 크라프트 프로필 - 오스트리아 스키점프 레전드이자 세계 기록 보유자"}'::jsonb,
